      "body": "Nevermind, I just read https://arxiv.org/html/2502.11880v1 and I see that it's using 3 trits per 5 bits while also making the matmul operations efficient, so there's already been optimization here. Storing 5 trits per 8 bits might still be possible but would increase lookup tables size by a lot. It's still an option but it would only improve space efficiency by 5% or so.",
